<title>USA: Regal-Beloit acquires Marathon Electric.</title>
<headline>Regal-Beloit acquires Marathon Electric.</headline>
<dateline>BELOIT, Wis. 1997-03-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Regal-Beloit Corp said Wednesday it paid $278 million to acquire Marathon Electric Manufacturing Corp.</p>
<p>The purchase price for the motor manufacturer was $38 million higher than Regal-Beloit initially announced and came after further negotiations with Marathon Electric shareholders.  </p>
<p>As part of the financing for the acquisition, power transmission system and tool maker Regal-Beloit said it entered into a five-year revolving loan, which can also be used for general working capital and future acquisitions.</p>
<p>Regal-Beloit shares were unchanged at 22-7/8 Wednesday.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787))</p>
